    (property "Pins_source" "datasheets/discrete-and-power/RECOM-RPA20-AW.pdf PD-8 Pin Connections (Single): 1 +Vin, 2 -Vin, 3 CTRL, 4 -Vout, 5 Trim, 6 +Vout; 3 is not fitted on the standard part without the /P or /N suffix, Trim is (PD-1 Note 2)" (at 91.44 370.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
    (property "Note" "THE INSTRUMENT'S SUPPLY, ISOLATED (ADR 0027): input across the rack's +12 V and -12 V, so the instrument's current loops rail to rail and never enters the rack's ground; output +12 V to the load switch, return on PWR_GND, which meets the module's grounds only through NT-UMB-MOD and NT-DIG-MOD. The standard RPA20-2412SAW has no CTRL pin (PD-1 Note 2): always on; Trim open = 12 V nominal. Input fuse per RECOM's PD-5 Note 5: PTC-ISO. The RP20-2412SAW drops into the same holes (footprint's descr)" (at 91.44 370.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
    (property "Manufacturer" "RECOM" (at 91.44 370.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
