    (property "Note" "Across the isolation barrier AT the converter, ISO_VIN_POS to PWR_GND: with L-CM-ISO in the loop it takes the 550 kHz current through U-ISO's isolation capacitance (1100 pF typ, RECOM-RPA20-AW.pdf PD-5) home beside the converter. 22 nF C0G 50 V, chosen with the choke by power-entry/sim 'cm-loop' (power-entry.md, The common mode). On the +12 V side so PTC-ISO covers it if it fails short" (at 193.04 370.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
